#: src/lib/coach-marks/copy.svelte.ts
msgid "This chart shows the insulin that the loop added to your scheduled basal or removed from it. It includes temp basals and automatic boluses. Use the switches below the chart to show manual temp basals, suspends and inferred delivery."
