#: src/lib/coach-marks/copy.svelte.ts
msgid "One row for each block"
msgstr "Osobny wiersz dla każdego przedziału"

#: src/lib/coach-marks/copy.svelte.ts
msgid "Each row shows the observed value, the profile value, the number of days or events and the confidence. Select a row to see the days or events for that figure."
