#: ../portal/src/routes/docs/installation/portainer/+page.svelte
msgid "The stack uses the same restart policy and log rotation as the <0>Docker Compose bundle</0>. Portainer stacks do not read override files. To keep your own logging driver, edit the <1/> section of each service in the stack editor instead."
